Package: eu4dll
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Japanese display support for Europa Universalis IV (Linux)
 This package provides the EU4dll preload library, which makes
 Europa Universalis IV (Linux, v1.37.5) render double-byte text,
 together with the eu4dll_translations mod: Japanese localisation
 files and generated fonts (Noto Sans CJK JP) that the library
 needs to display Japanese in game.
 .
 The library is installed as /usr/lib/eu4dll/libeu4dll.so and the
 mod data as /usr/share/eu4dll/mod/. Run eu4dll-install-mod once
 per user to copy the mod into the Paradox user directory and
 enable it, and start the game with the eu4dll-launch wrapper or
 with LD_PRELOAD=/usr/lib/eu4dll/libeu4dll.so.
